  "details": "Video showing bug: https://youtu.be/jVgerxgTrKI\n\nReddit post going into detail of bug: https://www.reddit.com/r/VRchat/s/aO9bYPjczC\n\nVRC support said they don't know what to do, so try and submit a bug report. So far I have found only one other person with this issue. Completely different PC build with barely any similarities, and they are in a different region in the US as well. This issue happens if you join any world and just listen to people talk. Can happen multiple times a minute or not for a few. Can even happen in worlds with 1 or 2 other people. At this point it is suspected to be either an ISP or VRC issue, or a mixture of the two. I believe the bug might stem from the steam audio update since I think it started happening at the same time as the update.",
